e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C7_pR_KeKykQ7kNvwEXIW8e&_nc_oc=AdqDK_xqfuORyO6lwmuWxlCpCAqW5mfEIwNXOlAm0whlt-a0SrngU8Ns53U07Kvovcw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGTcyRCk82tvdN0ReFOe-D-vmG6JiSqkRIfSqFO5Rtxdw&oe=6A8831B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aYgYZAgjjDEQ7kNvwE-42hI&_nc_oc=AdpkEB4ibPK5EIy9Io8CyeRKtJ130XLg2BA4YcvmBb8GtDR82vaWWxzfraTjaBwDy0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEDeAqgim7tZ02VWum9O9PTzn0R1cLNZ7znbVhtIJW0IQ&oe=6A884153"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fGzErAcdjXsQ7kNvwEgMiCF&_nc_oc=AdpBoEx1x3ezu6Kmnrnc19CGAC-Q2KUIczMCOpeNdrzCr76bmp-cn5XDlLO2O0jXPW8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH2nBO7nhQWtw8szoDp84XZFbzbBKds5y1hmObV8_CeSg&oe=6A884CFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GorjGQX0BaUQ7kNvwFZHCdX&_nc_oc=Adom-hCNAZIqGWLskkLlKNQ-f-aBoLwyuT7fbxakRlmpkrxpbQWQ_In4nm2SewnAJeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFJd8k8tFGnMyjtC8aCH2zcdMUVfm2Jw3h1TM-jM1I9gQ&oe=6A884E4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nx33CJVg4MQ7kNvwHFtWGi&_nc_oc=AdpgMvQ3jipY_7AWCmQGIdDTwpgAlr28RhMyiMhUK45PPgRoj1xz5tOpKg5cFO3oNaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEa7-WMx6KulzVr6_BJKgMPSWlGgCgaRTirJdGpKvVXCA&oe=6A88377E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se